Bundled data

App/Sources/Resources/feed-snapshot.geojson is a copy of the public feed of
https://github.com/GeiserX/radares-anunciados-ha, bundled so the app works
offline on its first drive. It is data, not part of the program, and the GPL
does not cover it. The database is under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
and every feature carries its source's own attribution and licence in its
"attribution" property, among them:

- Dirección General de Tráfico (DGT), CC BY 4.0
- © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0
- Redacción ILEÓN (ileon.eldiario.es), CC BY-NC 4.0
- Policía Local de Murcia, weekly list as read in La Opinión de Murcia

The app shows each attribution verbatim on its sources screen.
